{"id":"556376307626a46e","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-ax-equality-term-substitution.md","title":"Equality Term Substitution Axiom","display":"ax-equality-term-substitution — Equality Term Substitution Axiom","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-ax-equality-term-substitution","aliases":["58-ax-equality-term-substitution"],"display":"ax-equality-term-substitution — Equality Term Substitution Axiom","depends_on":["[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-free-for]]","[[58-df-substitution-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-ax-equality-term-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-ax-equality-term-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-equality-term-substitution — Equality Term Substitution Axiom"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8ad179c98b9a237c\" href=\"?note=8ad179c98b9a237c\" title=\"58-df-free-for\">58-df-free-for</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60d957ce43061cb6\" href=\"?note=60d957ce43061cb6\" title=\"58-df-substitution-formula\">58-df-substitution-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma),\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\in V\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma),\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\in V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeFor}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeFor}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8ad179c98b9a237c\" href=\"?note=8ad179c98b9a237c\" title=\"58-df-free-for\">58-df-free-for</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\Sigma}:\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\mathrm{Var}_S\\rightharpoonup\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\Sigma}:\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\mathrm{Var}_S\\rightharpoonup\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"60d957ce43061cb6\" href=\"?note=60d957ce43061cb6\" title=\"58-df-substitution-formula\">58-df-substitution-formula</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}eq\\text{-}term\\text{-}subst} \\vdash \\forall s,t\\in \\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall x\\in \\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall \\varphi\\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\left(\\mathrm{FreeFor}(s,x,\\varphi)\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}(t,x,\\varphi)\\to\\left(s=t\\to\\left(\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\Sigma}(\\varphi,s,x)\\to\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\Sigma}(\\varphi,t,x)\\right)\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}eq\\text{-}term\\text{-}subst} \\vdash \\forall s,t\\in \\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall x\\in \\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall \\varphi\\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\left(\\mathrm{FreeFor}(s,x,\\varphi)\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}(t,x,\\varphi)\\to\\left(s=t\\to\\left(\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\Sigma}(\\varphi,s,x)\\to\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\Sigma}(\\varphi,t,x)\\right)\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该公理表达等词的<strong>代入性质</strong></li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 中自由，则从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s = t\">\\(s = t\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[s/x]\">\\(\\varphi[s/x]\\)</span> 可推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[t/x]\">\\(\\varphi[t/x]\\)</span></li>\n<li><strong>自由度条件</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeFor}(t, x, \\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeFor}(t, x, \\varphi)\\)</span> 保证代入不导致约束变元捕获</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-free-for","status":"resolved","id":"8ad179c98b9a237c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-free-for]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"60d957ce43061cb6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-substitution-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma),\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\in V$ (see [[58-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-free-for","status":"resolved","id":"8ad179c98b9a237c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FreeFor}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-free-for]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"60d957ce43061cb6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\Sigma}:\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\mathrm{Var}_S\\rightharpoonup\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)$ (see [[58-df-substitution-formula]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma),\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreeFor}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\Sigma}:\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\mathrm{Var}_S\\rightharpoonup\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}eq\\text{-}term\\text{-}subst} \\vdash \\forall s,t\\in \\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall x\\in \\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall \\varphi\\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\left(\\mathrm{FreeFor}(s,x,\\varphi)\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}(t,x,\\varphi)\\to\\left(s=t\\to\\left(\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\Sigma}(\\varphi,s,x)\\to\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\Sigma}(\\varphi,t,x)\\right)\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"s = t","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi[s/x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi[t/x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreeFor}(t, x, \\varphi)","display":false}],"bytes":1402,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-ax-equality-term-substitution.md|58-ax-equality-term-substitution]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["65418b505fc53093","8ad179c98b9a237c","60d957ce43061cb6"]}